# Mesa, platform rpi
### The ARM1176 has no NEON. u_format_unpack_neon.c turns it on for its own functions with
### #pragma GCC target ("fpu=neon") and picks them at run time: clang ignores the pragma, refuses the
### intrinsics ("needs target feature neon") and crashes in the backend with target("neon") on
### ARMv6. NO_FORMAT_ASM leaves out that file and its call in u_format.c
PKG_CFLAGS+=" -DNO_FORMAT_ASM"
